se,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","number":23,"title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-09-21T13:38:33Z","updated_at":"2025-11-07T16:44:01Z","closed_at":"2025-11-07T16:37:22Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Issue has been around since the `settings_changed` signal was introduced in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/c5ec847aa0230cd4fa090c2cbd1b1e9638a9253e\n- Reproducible in 4.2.stable, 4.5.stable, main branch\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.stable - macOS Sequoia (15.6.1) - Single-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Mobile) - dedicated AMD Radeon Pro 5500M - Intel(R) Core(TM) i9-9880H CPU @ 2.30GHz (16 threads) - 32.00 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhenever a project setting is changed, the ProjectSettings.settings_changed signal is triggered twice.\n\nThis has been around since the signal was introduced in 4.2\n\nOn further investigation, the first trigger is the actual setting change, the second is because the project features setting `application/config/features` is recalculated every time, and its value is set, and hence the signal is emitted, even if the old and new values are the same.\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/149a4b4ca12e2baf700020fc10f00d5b0a5e9f0d/core/config/project_settings.cpp#L1148\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Download the MRP. It contains an empty project with a simple addon that listens to the project `ProjectSettings.settings_changed` signal\n2. Go to Project Settings -> Plugins and enable the MRP plugin. You will see that this itself triggers the signal twice.\n3. Once enabled, any project setting change will trigger the signal twice.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/47f36d21-a044-4370-a466-b887b919ef1e\n\nThe script in the MRP is as follows\n\n``` gdscript\n@tool\nextends EditorPlugin\n\nfunc _enter_tree() -> void:\n\tProjectSettings.settings_changed.connect(_on_project_settings_changed)\n\t\nfunc _on_project_settings_changed() -> void:\n\tprint(\"_on_project_settings_changed\")\n\t\nfunc _exit_tree() -> void:\n\tProjectSettings.settings_changed.disconnect(_on_project_settings_changed)\n\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[double-signal.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22451948/double-signal.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110747/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110747/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}